# Data & models (large/binary artifacts) -- only exclude the raw/intermediate
# pipeline stages (hourly weather data, per-hour features/losses/physics).
# The final pre-computed forecast outputs used by forecast_api.py ARE
# committed on purpose -- Render's free tier has ephemeral disk, so these
# files must live in the repo for the deployed API to have anything to
# serve. See README deployment notes.
#
# Required, committed data files (do NOT ignore these):
#   data/forecasts_all_locations.json
#   data/champion_decisions_m8.csv
#   data/scoreboard_m7_folds.csv
#   data/horizon_error_curve_final.csv   <- loaded at import time; missing
#                                            this crashes the app on startup
data/parquet/
data/features/
data/losses/
data/physics/
data/monthly/
data/scoreboard_m6.csv
data/scoreboard_m7_longhorizon.csv
data/horizon_error_curve.csv
data/horizon_error_detail.csv
data/forecasts_new_locations.json
*.pkl
*.joblib
*.h5
*.pt
*.pth
*.onnx
*.model

